    "PhaseA runs the bounded native DFS uniqueness count after EVERY genuinely stuck floor test (a floor solve that ended stuck; a budget stop or a contradiction is never a refusal), at every rung; a proved second solution rejects the group permanently (never retested at a later rung), an unknown or capped count keeps the entry with proof \"unknown\"",
